# === Engine: Godot ===
.godot/
*.translation
# export_presets.cfg is tracked deliberately. It is normally ignored because
# it can hold signing credentials, but this one holds none — codesigning is
# off and there are no passwords in it. Without it in the repository there is
# no way to build the game from a fresh clone, which was the point of adding
# it. Re-add this ignore if signing is ever configured here.
#export_presets.cfg
.mono/
data_LastMagazine*/
